WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
Next time, Melancholy! Airi's double cross.

00:00:18.870 --> 00:00:19.670
Geez...

00:00:20.140 --> 00:00:24.020
Elves shouldn't have to resort to riding something like this.

00:00:24.420 --> 00:00:26.110
Are you listening, Nowa?

00:00:26.280 --> 00:00:26.890
Huh?

00:00:27.090 --> 00:00:29.790
Yeah, it's really nice.

00:00:33.030 --> 00:00:36.970
You know, it's fun being with you like this. {More literal: It's fun doing things like this if I'm with you}

00:00:37.110 --> 00:00:38.540
Is that so?

00:00:40.670 --> 00:00:46.070
Now that the Queen's Blade tournament is over, we should be heading straight back to the forest,

00:00:46.520 --> 00:00:50.780
but after hearing Nowa's request, we're going to take a slight detour.

00:00:51.990 --> 00:00:56.230
I know I have an outdated way of thinking.

00:00:56.830 --> 00:00:58.860
The elders will be no different.

00:01:00.140 --> 00:01:06.050
So, I've decided to ensure that the elders will approve of Nowa.

00:01:08.930 --> 00:01:11.540
In-struc-tor.

00:01:21.260 --> 00:01:23.020
Instructor...

00:01:36.170 --> 00:01:40.060
Nowa, the Swamp Witch's influence hasn't disappeared yet.

00:01:37.170 --> 00:01:39.120
So amazing!

00:01:41.530 --> 00:01:42.940
Even as we speak...

00:01:42.650 --> 00:01:47.070
Wow, it's huge! Instructor, here, over here!

00:01:43.500 --> 00:01:46.410
danger might be lurking around the forest.

00:01:49.240 --> 00:01:55.320
I believe the new queen can suppress the Swamp Witch, but there's no guarantee.

00:01:50.500 --> 00:01:54.200
These puffs... they're so beautiful!

00:01:57.330 --> 00:02:00.890
As a warrior, I've heard unsettling rumors...

00:01:58.540 --> 00:02:00.950
Hey! Over here!

00:02:01.920 --> 00:02:05.060
That's why I can't afford to take things easy.

00:02:12.260 --> 00:02:13.980
Hey Nowa, slo...

00:02:13.970 --> 00:02:15.960
What is it, Instructor?

00:02:19.350 --> 00:02:20.050
Nowa!

00:02:24.130 --> 00:02:28.550
I can't move my body. {More liberal TLs: I can't move my body/My body feels weak/I feel weak}

00:02:29.070 --> 00:02:30.430
What a hopeless girl.

00:02:32.440 --> 00:02:35.690
If you're not able to calculate your remaining stamina...

00:02:36.520 --> 00:02:39.530
you won't be able to use your full strength when you need it the most.

00:02:39.910 --> 00:02:41.530
Nowa, 20 points.

00:02:51.610 --> 00:02:52.110
Nowa...

00:02:54.920 --> 00:02:57.660
Instructor, it's huge, isn't it?

00:02:59.150 --> 00:03:00.650
Is this the sea?

00:03:01.360 --> 00:03:02.180
Yeah.

00:03:02.380 --> 00:03:04.190
It's your first time seeing it, right?

00:03:04.190 --> 00:03:04.880
Yes!

00:03:06.820 --> 00:03:08.620
We'll stop by, right?

00:03:10.150 --> 00:03:10.900
Don't.

00:03:11.000 --> 00:03:13.350
How much further do you plan on taking this detour?

00:03:13.400 --> 00:03:14.500
Wait, Nowa.

00:03:18.180 --> 00:03:19.040
It's amazing...

00:03:19.140 --> 00:03:20.020
amazing...

00:03:20.120 --> 00:03:21.720
It's so amazing!

00:03:22.920 --> 00:03:25.330
It's the sea!

00:03:41.110 --> 00:03:42.730
Instructor.

00:03:43.420 --> 00:03:44.220
You idiot!

00:03:44.520 --> 00:03:46.220
Who would go in naked?

00:03:46.850 --> 00:03:49.730
At least stretch first.

00:03:50.740 --> 00:03:54.670
It's salty, the water is salty.

00:03:55.300 --> 00:03:57.420
The water in the sea is like that. {seawater? :x}

00:04:00.530 --> 00:04:02.400
Nowa, don't move away from there.

00:04:04.660 --> 00:04:06.920
<i>Eagle Talon!</i>

00:04:12.630 --> 00:04:13.530
I missed.

00:04:23.170 --> 00:04:25.730
W-wear this. {She literally says 'stick this on your body'}

00:04:26.520 --> 00:04:26.970
Here.

00:04:28.410 --> 00:04:31.310
I'm fine without clothes.

00:04:31.900 --> 00:04:32.550
Listen!

00:04:33.050 --> 00:04:36.050
This place is different from the elven forest springs. {or springs of the elven forest}

00:04:36.210 --> 00:04:37.010
Ok!

00:04:38.210 --> 00:04:39.010
I'm done.

00:04:40.560 --> 00:04:41.230
Very good.

00:04:44.510 --> 00:04:45.950
We can't, no matter what?

00:04:45.950 --> 00:04:46.630
It's been decided.

00:04:46.850 --> 00:04:48.630
No matter what?

00:04:49.180 --> 00:04:51.870
It's rare that you're this disobedient.

00:04:52.560 --> 00:04:54.350
I-Is that so?

00:05:01.520 --> 00:05:02.330
You know...

00:05:02.830 --> 00:05:06.330
It's probably alright for us to rest for a night.

00:05:06.670 --> 00:05:07.480
Really!

00:05:07.820 --> 00:05:08.160
Yes.

00:05:08.550 --> 00:05:09.330
I got it!

00:05:09.530 --> 00:05:10.630
One night, right?

00:05:11.100 --> 00:05:11.900
It's a promise then.

00:05:12.200 --> 00:05:14.800
We'll leave for the elven forest tomorrow.

00:05:42.900 --> 00:05:43.100
Here.

00:05:58.990 --> 00:06:00.580
Look out, Instructor!

00:06:06.510 --> 00:06:08.320
Sorry 'bout that! {These next two girls speak in slang Japanese.}

00:06:15.620 --> 00:06:17.650
I won't hold back!

00:06:18.340 --> 00:06:20.990
We'll be famous once we beat these warriors.

00:06:21.190 --> 00:06:22.590
Seriously awesome!

00:06:22.690 --> 00:06:25.830
It's amazing, just like you said.

00:06:26.140 --> 00:06:28.290
There's no need to hold back against us. {She says need but if you want to condense: Don't hold back against us.}

00:06:28.390 --> 00:06:28.690
Bring it.

00:06:29.280 --> 00:06:31.770
Well then, here I go!

00:06:36.040 --> 00:06:39.200
Exploding Lightning Serve! {2nd word = lightning, so some Alts: Flashing Thunderbolt Serve, Exploding Lightning Serve}

00:06:46.020 --> 00:06:47.420
It's coming to your side, Nowa. {Alt: To you, Nowa.}

00:06:48.040 --> 00:06:51.150
Okay, here, Instructor!

00:06:51.580 --> 00:06:52.180
Alright!

00:06:57.900 --> 00:06:59.110
No way!

00:06:59.320 --> 00:07:00.610
Seriously? Isn't this bad?

00:07:01.080 --> 00:07:02.480
You're awesome!

00:07:03.420 --> 00:07:05.170
Y-your movements aren't bad either.

00:07:05.570 --> 00:07:07.070
Nowa, 90 points.

00:07:07.220 --> 00:07:08.760
Really? Really?

00:07:08.890 --> 00:07:10.350
Yes, r-really.

00:07:11.260 --> 00:07:13.910
However, the battle is not yet over.

00:07:14.210 --> 00:07:15.710
Stay vigilant.

00:07:16.660 --> 00:07:17.570
Your serve.

00:07:22.290 --> 00:07:24.880
What's this feeling?

00:07:27.100 --> 00:07:28.020
Even though I...

00:07:28.340 --> 00:07:30.480
I have to return to the elven forest...

00:07:32.160 --> 00:07:37.820
Protecting the elven forest <i>is</i> my duty and my pleasure.

00:07:39.890 --> 00:07:43.040
But what's this sensation, I wonder.

00:07:44.490 --> 00:07:47.520
The intense feeling of satisfaction and happiness,

00:07:48.770 --> 00:07:51.080
by just being together with Nowa.

00:07:59.900 --> 00:08:02.110
Ruu, it's alright.

00:08:02.410 --> 00:08:04.210
I'll definitely find it.

00:08:10.540 --> 00:08:11.950
What is it, Nowa?

00:08:12.790 --> 00:08:13.950
Is there something in the sea?

00:08:16.710 --> 00:08:18.840
Instructor, you don't remember?

00:08:20.140 --> 00:08:21.740
Nevermind, it's okay.

00:08:24.150 --> 00:08:26.780
Nowa, that orb, did you get that earlier?

00:08:26.880 --> 00:08:29.920
Yes, it seems to shine dimly in the dark.

00:08:30.490 --> 00:08:31.050
I see.

00:08:32.160 --> 00:08:33.580
Let's go to sleep, Instructor.

00:08:34.100 --> 00:08:34.510
Ok.

00:08:41.340 --> 00:08:42.050
A long time ago,

00:08:42.250 --> 00:08:48.050
she told me the sea contained a mysterious stone.

00:08:49.760 --> 00:08:51.580
A stone of thoughts.

00:09:03.690 --> 00:09:04.240
Shush!

00:09:04.740 --> 00:09:07.470
If we can't keep it a secret, it'd be meaningless, right?

00:09:14.470 --> 00:09:16.090
We're freakin' awesome, ya?

00:09:16.350 --> 00:09:20.400
Yeah, seriously cool. We gotta huge catch. {Slang}

00:09:22.170 --> 00:09:23.500
Huh?

00:09:28.880 --> 00:09:32.350
Ain't that the warrior? Why's she out at night? {Slang}

00:09:32.520 --> 00:09:35.050
Like I'd know.

00:09:38.950 --> 00:09:41.020
It's too dark to find it, Ruu?

00:09:47.940 --> 00:09:50.100
Looks like I really have to swim and find it.

00:10:40.450 --> 00:10:41.080
Nowa...

00:10:47.960 --> 00:10:50.390
Nowa, where in the world have you gone?

00:11:15.700 --> 00:11:18.260
What happened, Nowa?

00:11:22.120 --> 00:11:22.730
What the...

00:11:27.740 --> 00:11:28.380
Crap!

00:11:28.880 --> 00:11:30.880
Evindel's sword broke. {Evindel seems like the name of the other girl}

00:11:41.390 --> 00:11:42.160
It escaped.

00:11:44.140 --> 00:11:44.990
You alright?

00:11:46.840 --> 00:11:47.330
Yeah.

00:11:47.730 --> 00:11:50.330
That thing ran off, warrior.

00:11:50.890 --> 00:11:51.950
More importantly...

00:11:59.970 --> 00:12:01.130
She looks alright.

00:12:01.780 --> 00:12:02.890
It seems so.

00:12:03.110 --> 00:12:05.570
My apologies, but I'm looking for my companion.

00:12:05.820 --> 00:12:08.890
If that's the case, I just saw her at the rock ledges.

00:12:09.720 --> 00:12:10.400
Rock ledges?

00:12:11.110 --> 00:12:11.740
That's right.

00:12:12.650 --> 00:12:14.140
Why is she at such a place?

00:12:15.640 --> 00:12:19.330
Over there the currents change suddenly all the time, so it's really dangerous.

00:12:18.420 --> 00:12:19.880
Nowa! Nowa!

00:12:19.700 --> 00:12:22.050
It seems like monsters appear there often as well.

00:12:22.400 --> 00:12:23.450
You mean that thing we just encountered?

00:12:23.510 --> 00:12:23.930
Probably.

00:12:24.410 --> 00:12:25.930
It's true!

00:12:28.900 --> 00:12:30.670
Ruu, where are you?

00:12:32.740 --> 00:12:34.020
Nowa, are you here?

00:12:34.760 --> 00:12:36.770
Ruu, where's Nowa?

00:12:39.270 --> 00:12:40.500
That orb.

00:12:42.360 --> 00:12:42.790
Nowa!

00:12:52.530 --> 00:12:53.970
Where are you, Nowa?

00:12:54.600 --> 00:12:56.230
Don't tell me, that monster...

00:12:56.710 --> 00:12:57.290
No!

00:12:57.690 --> 00:12:59.990
What a blunder, what carelessness!

00:13:02.560 --> 00:13:06.730
There's no way the past me would have not sensed the monster's presence. {Alt: In the past, there's no way I wouldn't have sensed the monster's presence.}

00:13:07.690 --> 00:13:09.960
Some elven battle instructor I am.

00:13:10.690 --> 00:13:14.970
This was no time to spend idle time in a place like this. {Literally: This was no time to spend idle time in a place like this. }

00:13:15.740 --> 00:13:20.130
I knew that, and yet I...

00:13:36.560 --> 00:13:38.160
The current seems to have stopped.

00:13:41.010 --> 00:13:42.090
Where is this place?

00:13:46.870 --> 00:13:50.110
It looks like the back of the island.

00:13:51.860 --> 00:13:52.500
Ruu!

00:13:53.510 --> 00:13:54.670
You're not wet.

00:13:55.480 --> 00:13:57.860
The tide receded and connected the lands?

00:14:00.460 --> 00:14:01.610
Nowa's nearby.

00:14:02.630 --> 00:14:03.840
Please be safe.

00:14:07.260 --> 00:14:09.490
Ruu, I'm sorry about this, but give me my clothes.

00:14:12.640 --> 00:14:14.800
Please quickly warm up and eat.

00:14:15.660 --> 00:14:16.490
Thank you.

00:14:16.870 --> 00:14:19.040
I hope it suits your tastes.

00:14:21.860 --> 00:14:23.000
It's delicious!

00:14:23.200 --> 00:14:25.000
Did you make this, Nyx-san?

00:14:25.880 --> 00:14:26.340
Yes.

00:14:26.750 --> 00:14:32.140
Because the seaweed here grows in turbulent waters, I can get very good soup stock. {May have to find a better phrase for raging waters; others could be stormy seas, raging waves, turbulent waters/seas, etc}

00:14:35.530 --> 00:14:37.160
Nyx-san, you're amazing.

00:14:37.230 --> 00:14:39.350
No, not at all.

00:14:39.890 --> 00:14:43.090
I can only survive because Funikura-sama is with me.

00:14:44.700 --> 00:14:46.110
It's sleeping now.

00:14:54.920 --> 00:14:57.530
It's better to throw that staff away.

00:14:57.530 --> 00:14:58.070
Huh?

00:14:58.550 --> 00:15:00.680
Somehow, it gives off a bad vibe.

00:15:01.180 --> 00:15:04.680
Nyx-san, you can't hold onto that staff forever.

00:15:05.160 --> 00:15:05.960
But...

00:15:06.320 --> 00:15:09.680
I can't do anything without Funikura-sama.

00:15:10.000 --> 00:15:11.300
That's not true!

00:15:11.690 --> 00:15:14.530
You're able to make such a delicious meal.

00:15:14.940 --> 00:15:16.650
B-But...

00:15:21.870 --> 00:15:23.220
Nowa, I've been looking for you.

00:15:23.610 --> 00:15:24.580
Instructor!

00:15:29.110 --> 00:15:31.430
You're totally soaked, Ruu. {Fucking monkey screws up the last half of the audio for this line.}

00:15:32.130 --> 00:15:34.490
You're having a meal over here without a care in the world.

00:15:35.100 --> 00:15:37.270
Nyx-san just made me some food.

00:15:37.460 --> 00:15:38.830
Fire user Nyx, {She uses tsukai which can be defined as familiar (which she is not) or a "user". Regardless, both aren't mages as they are much weaker than mages. Put whatever, if you want to be technical, don't use mage. Keep it consistent with line 235 as the same problem appears}

00:15:39.430 --> 00:15:42.030
the monster from before, was that your doing?

00:15:42.030 --> 00:15:42.830
What...?

00:15:43.090 --> 00:15:45.310
Nyx-san was with me the entire time.

00:15:45.310 --> 00:15:46.130
Don't be fooled.

00:15:46.640 --> 00:15:48.410
The monster is the staff known as Funikura.

00:15:49.100 --> 00:15:53.070
Nyx is being possessed by the staff and is nothing more than a weak-hearted human.

00:15:53.250 --> 00:15:56.870
No, she's not. Nyx-san is very kind and very...

00:16:00.660 --> 00:16:04.170
We're leaving immediately and returning to the elven forest.

00:16:04.330 --> 00:16:07.550
But Instructor, you're totally soaked, and if you don't dry yourself...

00:16:07.550 --> 00:16:08.240
There's no need!

00:16:08.640 --> 00:16:09.440
We're departing now.

00:16:09.440 --> 00:16:10.930
B-But...

00:16:10.930 --> 00:16:17.460
I-If you don't mind, how about having some warm seaweed soup?

00:16:17.470 --> 00:16:20.060
You have my thanks for taking care of Nowa,

00:16:20.200 --> 00:16:23.570
but I'm not in the mood to get along with a monster. {or get along}

00:16:24.070 --> 00:16:24.970
Excuse me then.

00:16:24.970 --> 00:16:26.000
Instructor...

00:16:28.160 --> 00:16:29.650
What is our mission?

00:16:30.580 --> 00:16:31.160
Answer me!

00:16:31.660 --> 00:16:34.060
My disciple, watchman of the forest, Nowa!

00:16:35.690 --> 00:16:37.550
Playtime's over.

00:16:57.980 --> 00:16:59.140
That thing is....

00:17:00.320 --> 00:17:04.710
Funikura-sama, forgive me!

00:17:07.350 --> 00:17:08.220
Nyx-san...

00:17:08.350 --> 00:17:09.080
Wait, Nowa!

00:17:12.270 --> 00:17:13.450
Nowa, are you alright?

00:17:14.540 --> 00:17:15.710
I'm fine.

00:17:16.660 --> 00:17:18.730
You know, to get good soup stock...

00:17:20.330 --> 00:17:24.230
The most important thing is temperature. {Literal: Control of fire.}

00:17:25.000 --> 00:17:26.020
Nyx-san...

00:17:26.710 --> 00:17:33.280
What? You won't eat food made by me, the wielder of righteous flames? {or wielder of righteous flames}

00:17:40.710 --> 00:17:42.050
Don't let your guard down, Nowa!

00:17:43.850 --> 00:17:45.480
Assholes will be assholes.

00:17:45.910 --> 00:17:49.150
You keep blabbering about how Funikura-sama is this and that...

00:17:49.850 --> 00:17:53.650
When actually you just plan to take Funikura-sama away from me.

00:17:53.650 --> 00:17:55.700
No, you're wrong! I just wanted to...

00:17:56.380 --> 00:17:58.770
Shut up!

00:18:06.580 --> 00:18:07.230
Instructor...

00:18:07.230 --> 00:18:07.840
Don't panic.

00:18:08.340 --> 00:18:10.440
She's just repeating simple attacks. {Alt TL: She's just cycling through simple attacks.}

00:18:10.940 --> 00:18:12.540
There'll eventually be an opening.

00:18:12.940 --> 00:18:14.220
When that happens, it'll be our path to victory.

00:18:14.420 --> 00:18:14.650
Alright.

00:18:30.550 --> 00:18:31.410
Thank goodness...

00:18:36.230 --> 00:18:36.830
Nowa!

00:18:40.110 --> 00:18:41.130
Did you see that?

00:18:41.430 --> 00:18:43.430
That's the extent of my power.

00:18:46.320 --> 00:18:47.180
How foolish.

00:18:47.760 --> 00:18:48.920
You say something?

00:18:49.020 --> 00:18:49.920
Huh?

00:18:52.420 --> 00:18:58.780
That power isn't yours, and you're unable to realize that it's actually that demon's power.

00:18:59.380 --> 00:19:11.130
All the blabbering, shut up! What's wrong with relying on Funikura-sama? It made me strong, and I'm the strongest!

00:19:15.330 --> 00:19:20.270
How pitiful you are, unable to live without depending on something.

00:19:23.450 --> 00:19:26.230
<i>Hurricane Fury!</i>

00:19:47.960 --> 00:19:49.630
Instructor, behind you!

00:19:53.030 --> 00:19:56.090
Funikura-sama, why are you doing this?

00:19:56.380 --> 00:19:58.550
Do you prefer the likes of her more?

00:19:59.290 --> 00:20:03.770
Even though the one who needs you is me...

00:20:04.280 --> 00:20:07.650
This thing is... trying to possess me?

00:20:27.680 --> 00:20:29.580
What is this?

00:20:31.560 --> 00:20:34.360
My heart is being eroded away. {eroded}

00:20:35.490 --> 00:20:36.050
Impossible!

00:20:36.850 --> 00:20:41.450
For me to rely on something to live...

00:20:42.510 --> 00:20:44.080
That can't be.

00:20:44.700 --> 00:20:47.660
That can't ever be...

00:20:55.540 --> 00:20:56.740
Instructor...

00:20:58.260 --> 00:20:58.910
Nowa...

00:20:59.380 --> 00:20:59.930
Nowa...

00:21:01.480 --> 00:21:02.090
Nowa!!

00:21:02.980 --> 00:21:07.890
Get away from her!

00:21:13.840 --> 00:21:15.160
Funikura-sama!

00:21:16.880 --> 00:21:19.760
Nyx-san, everybody's the same.

00:21:19.800 --> 00:21:21.440
We're lonely when nobody is around us.

00:21:21.650 --> 00:21:24.980
We can't live without relying on someone.

00:21:25.420 --> 00:21:31.500
But there'll come a time when you'll have to be alone!

00:21:33.690 --> 00:21:34.700
Nowa...

00:21:40.580 --> 00:21:42.000
Funikura-sama!

00:21:49.340 --> 00:21:51.390
Nyx-san went after it.

00:21:59.090 --> 00:22:03.990
I-I don't know how to swim, h-h-help me Funikura-sama.

00:22:20.460 --> 00:22:22.860
From the first time I met her in the elven forest,

00:22:23.380 --> 00:22:27.270
everything I've done and thought about was for her sake.

00:22:28.120 --> 00:22:33.110
I've always believed that Nowa needed me.

00:22:34.700 --> 00:22:38.200
However, that wasn't true.

00:22:39.250 --> 00:22:44.350
If anything, it was I, Nowa, who needed you. {Yeah confusing but that's what she says <_<}

00:22:45.250 --> 00:22:46.500
It was that simple.

00:22:46.990 --> 00:22:50.780
I'm probably no different than Nyx.

00:22:51.950 --> 00:22:57.910
Everyone can't make it alone, and we can't live without help from others.

00:22:58.770 --> 00:23:04.040
However, someday, the time will come when we have to be alone.

00:23:07.310 --> 00:23:07.990
Instructor,

00:23:09.330 --> 00:23:10.530
let's part ways here.

00:23:11.530 --> 00:23:12.080
Nowa...

00:23:13.380 --> 00:23:18.320
Is the reason because you'll cause me trouble if you return to the forest?

00:23:18.600 --> 00:23:24.240
That's one of the reasons, but it's not just that. I realized it when I met them.

00:23:25.440 --> 00:23:30.230
Reina, Echidna, and the others I met in the Queen's Blade tournament.

00:23:30.440 --> 00:23:32.940
They live their lives without depending on anyone.

00:23:34.210 --> 00:23:38.200
I want to try to see more and more of this world by myself.

00:23:39.530 --> 00:23:42.180
When did you start thinking like this?

00:23:42.960 --> 00:23:46.390
I decided while going on this journey.

00:23:47.080 --> 00:23:47.720
I see...

00:23:48.850 --> 00:23:52.360
In the end, I wanted you to have this.

00:23:54.370 --> 00:23:55.200
This is...

00:23:55.330 --> 00:23:56.760
The stone of thoughts.

00:23:57.460 --> 00:24:02.760
You warm it with your hands, and you'll be able to see the visage of the person you wish to meet.

00:24:02.820 --> 00:24:05.310
That's what you taught me a long time ago.

00:24:06.440 --> 00:24:08.630
You remembered well.

00:24:09.250 --> 00:24:12.360
That was the reason why I started collecting rocks.

00:24:12.960 --> 00:24:16.970
I'll never forget what you've told me.

00:24:17.940 --> 00:24:22.530
But when I finally found it, it broke.

00:24:24.360 --> 00:24:26.150
Even if I didn't have this stone...

00:24:28.330 --> 00:24:32.100
Even if I didn't have this stone, I would never forget you.

00:24:35.740 --> 00:24:38.820
I've lived for a thousand long years up until now,

00:24:39.490 --> 00:24:45.570
but the days I've spent with you are all wonderful and irreplaceable memories.

00:24:46.530 --> 00:24:50.100
Without even me realizing it, you've become extremely beautiful. {Was looking for synonyms and legal popped up.}

00:24:52.380 --> 00:24:55.360
There's nothing more I can teach you.

00:25:00.490 --> 00:25:01.310
Nowa...

00:25:02.610 --> 00:25:03.310
100 points.

00:25:14.400 --> 00:25:18.820
Nowa, there's nothing that can hold you back anymore.

00:25:19.840 --> 00:25:26.710
From now on experience even bigger things with your eyes, your ears, and your heart.

00:25:27.550 --> 00:25:34.100
I'm sure this vast world is overflowing with things that will arouse your curiosity. {Might need a more colloquial word for evoke}

00:25:34.800 --> 00:25:42.470
And someday we'll see each other again. But until then, farewell, Nowa.

00:27:53.110 --> 00:27:56.830
I thought I almost died. That damn annoying elf pisses me off!

00:27:56.920 --> 00:28:01.130
Funikura-sama, thank goodness you're alright.

00:28:01.130 --> 00:28:05.800
As long as you're with me, be it elves, nobles, the Swamp Witch, I'll beat them all away!

00:28:06.130 --> 00:28:08.180
While I'm at it, I'll beat away anything you say!

00:28:08.380 --> 00:28:11.740
Next time, Melancholy! Airi's double cross.

00:28:11.820 --> 00:28:18.100
I can't breathe. Funikura-sama, please spare me.
